content.thinking:
happy-dom DOES resolve descendant-selector `getComputedStyle` when the `<style>` block is in the document. So if I inject `css/app.css` into the document as a `<style>` block during mount, the bug-2 scenario can verify computed `display === 'none'` for the editing row's toggle and destroy.

